    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      401.76,
      311.0,
      447.83
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7, ofLand Acquisition Act, No.28 of 1964 (Amendment) that theGovernment intends to acquire the following land which isrequired for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      78.96,
      458.16,
      240.88,
      468.23
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land to be acquired :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      478.32,
      311.01,
      557.99
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of land in total extent of about 0.0489 Hectaredepicted as lot No. 01 in the Preliminary Plan No. Gam. 4065prepared by the Senior Superintendent of Surveys - GampahaDistrict situated in the village called Bendiyamulla in the GramaNiladhari Division No. 234 of Bandiyamulla North in theDivisional Secretary's Division of Gampaha in Gampaha Districtof the Western Province and more fully described as follows.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      567.89,
      311.0,
      635.56
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 01 \u2013 Name of the land: Dawatagahawatta;Description: Home Garden, 03 permanent buildings, onetemporary building, a cement constructed well and a mixcultivation available; Claimant: state; Original Claimant:K. D. L.C. Jayawardhana, No. 32/24, Second Lane, SiyaneRoad, Gampaha; Total Extent: 0.0489 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      643.2,
      311.14,
      710.87
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land are herebyrequired to appear personally or by agents duly authorized inwriting before me at Gampaha Divisional Secretariat on22.11.2017 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify tome in writing (in duplicate) on or before 15.11.2017 the natureof their interest in the land, the particulars of their claims for",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
